===Etymology===
{{dercat|sa|inc-pro|inh=1}}
From {{inh|sa|iir-pro|*kr̥šnás||black}}, from {{inh|sa|ine-pro|*kr̥snós||black}}.

Cognate with {{cog|sla-pro|*čьrnъ}} (whence {{cog|cu|чрънъ||black}} (Glagolitic spelling {{m|cu|ⱍⱃⱏⱀⱏ}}), {{cog|ru|чёрный}}, {{cog|bg|черен}}, {{cog|mk|црн}}, {{cog|cs|černý}}, {{cog|pl|czarny}}, {{cog|sk|čierny}}), {{cog|prg|kirsnan||black}}, {{cog|lt|kir̃snas}}.

